Package: pulsaros-whatsnew
Version: 1.0.2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-webkit-6.0
Recommends: pulsaros-branding
Description: Pulsar OS release notes viewer
 Shows a formatted window with the release notes (changelog) of Pulsar OS
 right after the system is updated. The notes are shipped inside this package,
 so the viewer works offline, and they come from the releases.d/ directory of
 the PKG repository. A dpkg Post-Invoke hook notifies the running user session
 and the window is shown once per set of new notes.
